TopDepthModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Returns the depth field of the top stack frame (indent depth of the current block). Parser stack utility.
    Provides: TopDepth(stack) -> d.
    DependsOn: none (leaf with no dependencies on other modules)
    Composition: Native Include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../TopDepth/TopDepth.sir).
